      <h3 class="ut-headline ut-headline--underline">Fall semester runs August 17, 2027 - January 15, 2028, and includes Fall &amp; Winter Terms</h3>
    <div class="ut-promo-list-wrapper">
              <div class="promo-list">
                <div class="content">
                      <h3 class="ut-headline">Fall Term 2027: August 23 - December 13, 2027</h3>
                                <div class="ut-copy">
              <p><br>&nbsp;</p><table style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td>August 23</td><td>First day of classes</td></tr><tr><td>September 6</td><td>Labor Day holiday; no classes held</td></tr><tr><td>September 8</td><td>Last day to drop a class without permission</td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%;">November 1 - 12</td><td>Priority registration for Spring 2028</td></tr><tr><td>November 17</td><td>Last day an undergraduate may: Q-drop a class; withdraw; change a class to pass/fail</td></tr><tr><td>November 22 - 27</td><td>Fall break / Thanksgiving; no classes held</td></tr><tr><td>December 6</td><td>Last class day</td></tr><tr><td>December 7 - 8</td><td>Study days</td></tr><tr><td>December 9 - 11 &amp;<br>13</td><td>Final exams</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Winter Term 2027</strong></p><table style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:27%;">December 14 -<br>January 15, 2028</td><td>Winter Term (optional; may be used for courses such as study abroad, etc.)</td></tr></tbody></table>
            </div>
                  </div>
      </div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item"> <div class="utexas-promo-list-container">
      <h3 class="ut-headline ut-headline--underline">Spring semester runs January 18 - June 7, 2028, and includes Spring &amp; May Terms</h3>
    <div class="ut-promo-list-wrapper">
              <div class="promo-list">
                <div class="content">
                      <h3 class="ut-headline">Spring Term 2028: January 18 - May 8, 2028</h3>
                                <div class="ut-copy">
              <p><br>&nbsp;</p><table class="table" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td>January 17</td><td>Martin Luther King, Jr. Day; no classes held</td></tr><tr><td>January 18</td><td>First day of classes</td></tr><tr><td>February 2</td><td>Last day to drop a class without permission</td></tr><tr><td>March 13 - 18</td><td>Spring Break</td></tr><tr><td>April 10 - 21</td><td>Priority registration for Summer 2028 and Fall 2028</td></tr><tr><td>April 19</td><td>Last day an undergraduate may: Q-drop a class; withdraw; change a class to pass/fail</td></tr><tr><td>May 1</td><td>Last class day</td></tr><tr><td>May 2 - 3</td><td>Study days</td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%;">May 4 - 6 &amp; 8</td><td>Final exams</td></tr><tr><td>May 13</td><td>University Commencement</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>May Term 2028</strong></p><table class="table" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:27%;">May 9 - June 7</td><td>May Term (optional; may be used for courses such as study abroad, etc.)</td></tr></tbody></table>
            </div>
                  </div>
      </div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item"> <div class="utexas-promo-list-container">
      <h3 class="ut-headline ut-headline--underline">Summer semester runs June 8 - August 21, 2028, and includes First Term, Second Term, Nine-week Term, and Summer Term</h3>
    <div class="ut-promo-list-wrapper">
              <div class="promo-list">
                <div class="content">
                                <div class="ut-copy">
              <table class="table" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td>June 8</td><td>First day of classes for First Term, Nine-week Term, and Summer Term</td></tr><tr><td>June 13</td><td>Last day to drop a class without permission for First Term, Nine-week Term, and Summer Term</td></tr><tr><td>June 29</td><td>Last day to change a class to pass/fail for First Term, Nine-week Term, and Summer Term</td></tr><tr><td>July 4</td><td>Independence Day holiday; no classes held</td></tr><tr><td>July 13</td><td>Last class day for First Term</td></tr><tr><td>July 14 - 15</td><td>Final exams for First Term</td></tr><tr><td>July 17</td><td>First day of classes for Second Term</td></tr><tr><td>July 20</td><td>Last day to drop a class without permission for Second Term</td></tr><tr><td>Aug 1</td><td>Last class day for Nine-week Term</td></tr><tr><td>Aug 2 - 3</td><td>Final exams for Nine-week Term</td></tr><tr><td>Aug 4</td><td>Last day to change a class to pass/fail for Second Term</td></tr><tr><td>August 18</td><td>Last class day for Second Term and Summer Term</td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%;">August 19 &amp; 21</td><td>Final exams for Second Term and Summer Term</td></tr></tbody></table>
            </div>
                  </div>
      </div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
