            <div class="ut-copy field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p><em>All published dates in the academic calendar have been approved and every effort has been made to ensure accuracy. However, on rare occurrence dates may be slightly adjusted.<span>&nbsp;</span></em></p>
