            <div class="ut-copy field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p><span>The mission of the Office of the Registrar at the University of Texas at Austin is to support the academic mission of the University by empowering every student to succeed and equipping faculty and staff with tools to excel. We achieve this by safeguarding and maintaining academic records, collaborating to provide services that benefit our students and the campus community; delivering excellent service, and leading campus efforts to support, contribute to, and enhance the academic and student experience.</span></p></div>
      
